{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "factor x^4 - 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "factor", "ucas": "factor x^4-1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "factor", "input": "x^4 - 1", "result": "(x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "factor x^4 - 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 3: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 3)\n  x = 3 mod 5: x = 3\n    x = 3 (mod 5)\nx = 8 (mod 15)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..14: 1 solution\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "crt", "ucas": "crt x = 2 mod 3, x = 3 mod 5", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "crt", "solutions": ["8"], "modulus": "15", "x": ["2 mod 3: x = 2", "2 (mod 3)", "3 mod 5: x = 3", "3 (mod 5)"], "method": "the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)", "headline": "the system", "more": ["x = 8 (mod 15)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..14: 1 solution"}], "files": [], "text": "the system\n  x = 2 mod 3: x = 2\n    x = 2 (mod 3)\n  x = 3 mod 5: x = 3\n    x = 3 (mod 5)\nx = 8 (mod 15)\n  how: the Chinese remainder theorem, pairwise (moduli that share factors must agree mod their gcd)\n  check: the solution substituted into every congruence: it holds; brute force over 0..14: 1 solution\n"}, "isError": false}}
